# The trusted runner's ed25519 public key, PEM. CI verifies receipts against the
# copy on the base revision, never the candidate's, so a pull request that edits
# this file changes nothing about the receipts judged with it.
#
# Not provisioned yet: until a key is here, every receipt is refused. The owner
# runs `tac runner init --write-pub` on the host, outside any agent session, and
# lands this file through a pull request.
